<title>USA: Shillington, Pa., adjusted TIC.</title>
<headline>Shillington, Pa., adjusted TIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Borough of Shillington, Pa., said Tuesday it recalculated Prudential Securities Inc's winning bid on the Borough's $2.965 mil lion general obligation bond issue.</p>
<p>The Borough said the true interest cost was 5.3295 percent reflecting the co st of bond insurance, not the 5.3013 percent originally calculated.</p>
